                            <comment id="16375563" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 24 Feb 2018 13:42:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user zjffdu opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2814&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2814&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

